<title>RUSSIA: Russia sets 30.19 pct interest payment on OFZ bond.</title>
<headline>Russia sets 30.19 pct interest payment on OFZ bond.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry set 30.19 percent as the interest payment on the fourth coupon of the series 24008 OFZ interest-bearing government bonds, the Central Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>		    fourth coupon	   third coupon</p>
<p>pct rate	  30.19		     33.70</p>
<p>rouble terms    75,268		    84,019</p>
<p>payment date    July 16, 1997	   April 16, 1997</p>
<p>--Anna Smirnova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
